# Draw Things art-generation queue (working state, not source) — a
# background batch actively reads/writes this directory; `git stash -u`
# (used by scripts/ci/land_task.sh) must not sweep it up mid-run. Ignored
# paths are excluded from `-u` (only `-a` includes them), so this keeps
# in-flight generation safe from any stash during a task landing.
tools/drawthings_queue/
